sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant L as Login UI
  participant P as AuthUserProvider
  participant API as CARE API (external)
  participant LS as localStorage
  U->>L: username/password (+reCAPTCHA)
  L->>P: signIn
  P->>API: auth login
  alt MFA required (temp_token in response)
    API-->>P: {temp_token}
    P->>LS: set mfa_temp_token
    P-->>U: navigate /2fa?redirect=...
    U->>P: OTP / backup code
    P->>API: verify 2FA
  end
  API-->>P: {access, refresh}
  P->>LS: set accessToken, refreshToken
  P-->>U: navigate(getRedirectOr("/"))  %% same-origin check
  loop every tokenRefreshInterval
    P->>API: tokenRefresh(refresh)
    API-->>P: new {access, refresh}
    P->>LS: overwrite
  end
  Note over P,LS: on refresh error: tokens removed
